  },
  {
   "start": 758.44,
   "end": 760.94,
   "text": "What I really need is just to finish this."
  },
  {
   "start": 760.94,
   "end": 761.94,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 761.94,
   "end": 766.52,
   "text": "I think as soon as I'm done with this row..."
  },
